Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:06:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): list every host's projects in New workspace

New workspace's project picker only listed the projects of the selected
host, so starting work on a project another host has meant switching the
host first, then finding the project. The picker now lists the projects
of every connected host. Picking one the selected host lacks moves the
form to a host that has it.

Fork-Change: F-15
